  "published": "2026-04-23T09:40:01.023Z",
  "releaseNotes": "- Code: `HtmlParser` `EmitTag` removes dead code in the `else` branch (the expression `x.HasFormattedParent || x.IsFormattedTag` was always equivalent to `x.HasFormattedParent` since `x.IsFormattedTag` is always `false` in that branch). Uses `name` directly to avoid re-computing `CurrentTagName()` for formatted/script tag checks. Also removes redundant `.ToLowerInvariant()` calls in `IsFormattedTag` and `IsScriptTag` since tag names are already lowercased at read time.",
